# Markdown and prose are excluded from the graph corpus on purpose.
#
# Graphify sends every document file to an LLM for semantic extraction, and that is the only part
# of a build that costs money. For this module the code graph is what the checkpoint protocol
# actually reads: callers, callees, and blast radius, all of which come from AST extraction and
# need no API key at all. The prose adds recurring cost for something no reviewer here queries.
#
# Graphify refuses to write an AST only graph when semantic extraction was requested and every
# chunk failed, so with the key disabled these files block the whole incremental update rather
# than merely being skipped. Excluding them is what lets the code graph refresh at all.
#
# This mirrors the identical exclusion in mod-playerbots, added during Task 6 for the same reason.
#
# To put them back: delete this file and re-run `graphify . --update` with a working key.
*.md
*.mdx
*.rst
*.txt
# CI workflow YAML is a document to graphify's extractor as well.
*.yml
*.yaml
*.html
